'''Tails''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BJCP]] and [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 804
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Tails
|name2 = Tails & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Tails & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Tails is a backline Sniper with [[Explosion]], on top of a 75% chance to [[Weaken]] and [[Curse]] [[:Category:Red Enemies|Reds]]/[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] for 5 seconds (6 seconds post-treasures).

Weaken is a great crowd-controlling ability on its own, able to significantly impede enemies by reducing their damage. Curse is situational for Reds, as few Non-Collab [[:Category:Red Enemies|Reds]] have abilities. However, [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] are heavily reliant on abusing said abilities, with many Starred Aliens specifically having their [[Warp]] disabled.

Keep in mind that Tails has fairly low DPS on his own, even for his range, and also has a small blindspot. His [[Explosion|Explosions]] do help to increase his potential output, but his lack of damage-boosting abilities strictly relegate him to crowd-control. The Explosion doesn't cover his blindspot fully, instead serving as an extension to his primary attack (reaches from 165 to 715), allowing him to potentially tag enemies barely out of his range and slightly increase his uptime to ''~79% on average'', being comparable to [[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]] in terms of CC reach.

Overall, a fantastic counter to [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], and can carry players into the Late/Endgame.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Sniper}}

